    "text": "At Ferndean, Jane carries a glass of {WATER} in to the blind master, {SCARRED} and alone. He knows her {TOUCH} at once. “You are altogether a human being, Jane? You are certain of that?” She is rich now, and {INDEPENDENT}, and she means to stay: as his {NURSE}, his {COMPANION}, and more, if he will have her.",
